00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:56.150
It is very partisan.

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.849
It is very one sided.

00:03:57.849 --> 00:04:00.830
One side has science on their side.

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:02.440
The other side does not.

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:03.440
This is not a joke.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.440
This is not a drill.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.780
This is really where we are right now.

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:12.569
There is one side, Fox News viewers, Trump
voters, Republicans that believe this absolute

00:04:12.569 --> 00:04:14.790
