00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:51.650
Why is that a horrifying number?

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:54.470
Because it's not enough for herd immunity
bait based on.

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:58.770
So the required herd immunity is based on
